                "url": "https://wahanatotalita.com"
            },
            "serviceType": "Corporate Event Management & Government MICE Procurement",
            "description": "Jasa EO paket fullboard meeting kedinasan menginap (residential) di Yogyakarta, Solo, Jakarta & seluruh Indonesia. Kamar hotel twin share, ballroom, SPJ & faktur pajak.",
